      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The closest we have to this is a somewhat hidden settings menu. When you start VRChat, hold the LEFT SHIFT button. after a few seconds a menu should pop up giving you options to change your resolution and graphics. Honestly, I don't see any sort of graphical change when going from VRHigh, to VRLow, or even DesktopLow. Changing the resolution would probably help the most.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
